{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Probably wanted to cause as much chaos\nas possible, you know?": "",
  "He probably just wanted to stir up\nsome fast, messy chaos... I guess.": "",
  "Hey! The number got a hit in the search.": "",
  "...Ah! I found the number.\nIt's listed on the internet...": "",
  "It's apparently for the...\nAdvanced Drug Development Center?": "",
  "\"Advanced Drug Development Center\"?\nI guess it's a business number...": "",
  "What, do you know it?": "",
  "Three years ago...\nThere was a pretty famous murder there.": "",
  "Three years ago... there was\na famous murder there.": "",
  "A patient was killed,\nand their body dumped in the mountains.": "",
  "A patient was brutally murdered.\nThe body was dumped in the mountains.": "",
  "Whoa.": "",
  "And the man they arrested for it\nwas named Shinpei Okubo.": "",
  "And the man they arrested for it...\nwas Shinpei Okubo.": "",
  "Okubo, Okubo...": "",
  "Okubo...?": "",
  "Wait, he was your client, wasn't he?": "",
  "Wait, he was your client... wasn't he?": "",
  "Yeah, exactly.": "",
  "Yeah, that's him.": "",
  "He worked as a contract laundry man\nfor the center.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo was... a laundry guy\nover at the Center.": "",
  "Every two or three days, he'd stop by\nto pick up their dirty linens.": "",
  "Every two or three days,\nhe'd pick up their dirty linens.": "",
  "According to the police report, it was thought he\ncarried the body out in a bundle of sheets.": "",
  "And, according to the police report,\nhe carried the body out in a bundle of sheets.": "",
  "Right. And you defended him in court,\nand won...": "",
  "...Right. And you were the one responsible\nfor clearing Okubo's name. ": "",
  "But then he...\nHe got free and...": "",
  "But then, once he was free...": "",
  "You can stop there.": "",
  "But why would Shintani-sensei have called the ADDC?\nWho would he even talk to?": "",
  "But then... why would Shintani-sensei call the ADDC?\nWho would he even talk to?": "",
  "I bet we'll find out if we give them a ring.": "",
  "But it's getting late.": "",
  "Then again, it's getting late.": "",
  "You should go home.\nWe both need some shut eye, yeah?": "",
  "You should go home, Hoshino-kun.\nWe both need some shuteye, yeah?": "",
  "Yeah, we can start fresh tomorrow.\nWhere do we want to meet?": "",
  "Oh right...": "",
  "We wanna keep this a secret\nfrom Genda-sensei, after all.": "",
  "Gotta keep this a secret from\nGenda-sensei, after all.": "",
  "There's an arcade called Charles up on\nPark Boulevard. That should work for now.": "",
  "Okay, I'll let Kaito-san know.": "",
  "Okay, I'll be sure to let\nKaito-san know.": "",
  "Yeah. Thanks.": "",
  "Yeah, I'll see you.": "",
  "Yeah, I'll see you at Charles.": "",
  "(I told Hoshino I'd meet him at Charles today.\nGuess it's time to head over.)": "",
  "Sugiura...": "",
  "Kaito-san told me you'd be here.": "",
  "Don't forget about me next time, yeah?": "",
  "I wish you'd fuckin' forget about me. Is there a reason\nyour little gang needs to keep meeting up here?": "",
  "I wish you'd fuckin' forget about <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>. Come on,\nwhy do you have to meet <font_kind=yakuza_italic>here</font_kind> of all places anyway?": "",
  "It's so nice of you to let us use your store, Higashi-san.\nEspecially when you're clearly so opposed to the idea.": "",
  "It's so nice of you to let us use your place, Higashi-san.\nEspecially when you're clearly so opposed to the idea.": "",
  "Don't talk down to yakuza, kid.": "",
  "...Don't tease the yakuza, kid.": "",
  "It's okay, Higashi-san. I think we all know\nyou're nicer than you let on.": "",
  "It's all right, really! We can all tell\nyou're nicer than you let on.": "",
  "Damn, and you're braver than you look,\nHoshino-kun.": "",
  "Wow. You're braver than\nyou look, Hoshino.": "",
  "You got the skills to back it up?": "",
  "You have the skill\nto back that bravery up?": "",
  "Just a third degree blackbelt.": "",
  "Just a third degree\nblack belt in karate.": "",
  "Not that I've ever had to use it.": "",
  "Not that I've ever used it.": "",
  "Well, wanna call this meeting to order?": "",
  "So the gang's all here.": "",
  "Sure, I'll do the honors.": "",
  "Yeah. So we are.": "",
  "Masamichi Shintani of the Genda Law Office,\nhas been murdered.": "",
  "Masamichi Shintani, of the Genda Law Office,\nhas been murdered.": "",
  "Given that his eyes were gouged out,\nit's likely the Mole was responsible.": "",
  "Given that his eyes were gouged out,\nit's likely the Mole was responsible somehow.": "",
  "And I'll need all of your help\nto track him down.": "",
  "Everyone... I'll need your help\nto track him down.": "",
  "The ADDC, huh?\nWeird time for that to come up again.": "",
  "Again? It's come up before?": "",
  "You're already familiar\nwith them, Yagami-san?": "",
  "We can talk about that later. What's important now is,\nShintani called them before he was killed.": "",
  "Yeah. But the key thing now is that Shintani\ncalled them just before his death.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I don't get it.\nWhat's the connection between Shintani and the ADDC?)</color>": "",
  "Hm. I think I remember them being\nin the news a lot last year.": "",
  "I heard a little about the ADDC.\nWeren't they in the news a lot last year?": "",
  "Something about a new drug\nthat could win a Nobel Prize.": "",
  "Something like... a new drug\nthat could win a Nobel Prize?": "",
  "Yeah, here it is.": "",
  "Yes. Here it is.": "",
  "The ADDC's research into AD-9 has now been published\nin one of the world's leading scientific magazines...": "",
  "Yes, the ADDC would like to welcome reporters from Japan\nand abroad to discuss our research into AD-9...": "",
  "Leading to the gathering of reporters from both\nJapan and abroad that we have here today.": "",
  "You may already have read of it in some of the papers\npublished in scientific journals across the world...": "",
  "It's a brand new dementia drug.\nThey call it AD-9.": "",
  "It's a brand new dementia drug\ncalled AD-9.": "",
  "This was right after Director Kido\nfrom the ADDC published his paper on it.": "",
  "This was after the ADDC's Director Kido\npublished his paper on it.": "",
  "They're still undergoing clinical trials on larger animals, but apparently\nevery single mouse they've given it to has made a full recovery.": "",
  "They're still undergoing clinical trials on larger animals,\nbut apparently it's been reliably curing affected mice.": "",
  "The man giving the presentation\nhere is Dr. Ryusuke Kido.": "",
  "There... The man smiling for the cameras\nis Dr. Kido.": "",
  "A world leader in neurophysiology\nand the primary researcher on AD-9.": "",
  "A world leader in neurophysiology,\nand the primary researcher into AD-9.": "",
  "He's the one who showed me around the Center\nwhen I was looking into Okubo's case.": "",
  "Three years ago, during the Okubo case,\nhe showed me around the building.": "",
  "Guess he's been the director for a while now.": "",
  "From what I can tell, the Ministry of Health is increasing\nthe ADDC's budget to hasten the development of AD-9. ": "",
  "To get AD-9 ready for the public faster, the\nMinistry of Health is increasing the ADDC's budget.": "",
  "They're even adding another building to the Center.\nIt's a huge project.": "",
  "They're definitely committed to expanding it.\nThe ADDC is even getting another building.": "",
  "Yeah, and the ADDC's run by\nthe Medical Device Development Institute.": "",
  "They have all the land in the world to expand on.": "",
  "Damn good deal they've got.": "",
  "Sounds like they're rolling in it.": "",
  "I'm still not gettin' it, though.\nWhy'd Shintani go and call them?": "",
  "Hold up. There's one thing I don't get.\nWhy'd Shintani call them, anyway?": "",
  "That's what we're about to find out.\nAnd there's only one way to do that.": "",
  "That's what we're about to find out, right?\nAnd calling the center is how we'll do it.": "",
  "C'mon, you can't just take a man's phone!": "",
  "Hey, what the!?\nThat's not your phone!": "",
  "First off, we'll need to figure out\nwho Shintani was calling.": "",
  "Shintani must have called someone specific.\nWe gotta figure out who.": "",
  "Yeah. But how are we gonna do that\nover the phone?": "",
  "I suppose that all depends on your acting skills,\nDetective Yagami.": "",
  "It's your job to figure that out,\nDetective Yagami.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I just have to figure out who he called, and why.)</color>": "",
  "ADDC, front desk speaking.": "",
  "Advanced Drug Development Center,\nfront desk speaking.": "",
  "Hi there, ma'am. This is...": "",
  "This is Masamichi Shintani.\nI'm a lawyer from the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "This is Masamichi Shintani,\na lawyer from the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "Oh, it's good to hear from you,\nShintani-sama.": "",
  "Could put me through to the same\nperson I spoke to yesterday?": "",
  "I actually called to speak to someone yesterday.\nCould you put me through to the same person?": "",
  "Do you know the extension\nyou wish to reach?": "",
  "I can help you reach a staff member,\nbut do you have a name or extension?": "",
  "Oh, uh... It sorta slipped my mind, sorry.\nCan you maybe look into the transfer history?": "",
  "...It sorta slipped my mind, sorry.\nCan you maybe look into the transfer history?": "",
  "Hm...": "",
  "Why don't you just tell me what the call was about,\nand I'll connect you to the proper department.": "",
  "Why don't you just tell me what the call was about?\nI'll connect you to the proper department.": "",
  "Oh, in that case...": "",
  "That should be fine. Uh...": "",
  "It was about the Shinpei Okubo incident.": "",
  "A patient of yours was murdered\non-site three years ago.": "",
  "You're... not with the media, are you?": "",
  "Um... You're not with the media, are you?": "",
  "Nope, I'm most certainly a lawyer.": "",
  "No, no. I'm a lawyer, like I said.": "",
  "Why don't I connect you with our publicity department?\nThey'll know more about what you're looking for.": "",
  "Of course. Our PR department might have more\ninformation. May I connect you?": "",
  "It was about AD-9. The drug that can\nsupposedly cure dementia.": "",
  "It was about a specialized drug?\nA new medication for dementia, I believe.": "",
  "Sorry, but I'm not authorized to talk about that.\nWhy don't I connect you with our publicity department?": "",
  "That's... Sorry, but I'm not authorized to discuss that.\nCan I connect you to our PR department?": "",
  "Please hold, sir.": "",
  "Doesn't sound like you're\nmaking much progress.": "",
  "I dunno. Doesn't sound like you're\nmaking much progress.": "",
  "Thank you for waiting.": "",
  "It seems our publicity department never received\na call from a Shintani-sama.": "",
  "It seems our PR department never\nreceived a call from a Shintani-sama.": "",
  "...I see.\nThank you anyway.": "",
  "I see...\nThanks anyway.": "",
  "It was about the murders in Kamurocho.": "",
  "It was about the murders in Kamurocho,\nI believe.": "",
  "Excuse me, sir?": "",
  "Yes...? Ah, I'm sorry...": "",
  "I'm not sure where to connect you for that.": "",
  "In that case, I'm not sure what\ndepartment to connect you to.": "",
  "Right... Never mind, then.\nSorry.": "",
  "I see... Well, sorry about that.\n": "",
  "Well, who I am doesn't matter.": "",
  "Anyway, uh... I think a lawyer named Shintani\ncalled your office yesterday.": "",
  "Anyway, uh... I think a lawyer\nnamed Shintani called your office yesterday.": "",
  "I was wondering if you could connect me\nwith whoever he spoke to.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but I can't do that.\nIt's in violation of our personal information policy.": "",
  "Well the truth is...\nShintani-san passed away yesterday.": "",
  "The truth is... Shintani-sensei passed away\nyesterday, and I'm investigating.": "",
  "This is the last number he dialed,\nso I'm calling to ask about him.": "",
  "This is the last number he had dialed,\nso I'm calling to ask about him.": "",
  "Are you with the police?\nYou're not, are you?": "",
  "...Are you with the police?\nYou're not, are you?": "",
  "Er, not exactly.\nYou know what... I'll try back later.": "",
  "Er, not exactly.\nAnyway... gotta run.": "",
  "This is Takayuki Yagami,\nfrom the Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Ah... Hello there, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Ah... yes?": "",
  "I'm calling about a lawyer named Shintani\nwho I believe contacted you yesterday.": "",
  "Yesterday, I believe a lawyer named Shintani\ncontacted someone in your offices.": "",
  "I was wondering if you could connect me\nwith whomever he spoke to.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but that information is private.\nYou'll need a warrant if you want to know more.": "",
  "I really am sorry, sir.": "",
  "I see. Thank you anyway.": "",
  "This is Takayuki Yagami.\nI'm a lawyer from the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "This is Takayuki Yagami,\na lawyer from the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "Sorry, I don't.": "",
  "Oh, it was... uh...": "",
  "No way this happens over the phone.": "",
  "It'll be faster to just head over\nthere myself.": "",
  "It'll be faster to just head over\nto the ADDC myself.": "",
  "You think that's gonna work?": "",
  "Not sure, but I know the director, remember?\nWorst-case scenario, I come back empty-handed.": "",
  "Not sure, but I know the ADDC's director.\nWorst-case scenario, I come back empty-handed.": "",
  "I'll come with you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Kay, me and Higashi'll go check out what's going\non with the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "Alrighty. Me and Higashi'll go see\nwhat the Matsugane Family's up to, then.": "",
  "Shouldn't be tough with Hamura outta the picture.": "",
  "Shouldn't be tough with Hamura gone.": "",
  "Hey, I don't remember saying\nI was gonna help you...": "",
  "Come on. I didn't sign up for this...": "",
  "By the way, Yagami-san.": "",
  "What ever happened to that guy\nfrom three years ago? Shinpei Okubo.": "",
  "Remember that guy you saved? Shinpei Okubo, right?\nWhat happened to that guy?": "",
  "He's in the detention center.\nBeen there since they gave him his death sentence.": "",
  "He's in prison now. Death row.\nThat's where he'll stay until his time's up.": "",
  "Have you ever gone to see him, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yagami-san, have you ever\ngone to see him?": "",
  "No. Why would I?": "",
  "Nope. Not once.": "",
  "Why do you ask anyway?": "",
  "Why are you asking me this?": "",
  "I dunno,\nI was wondering what he was like.": "",
  "I dunno. I was wondering\nwhat Okubo was like.": "",
  "The case got tons of news coverage,\nyou know.": "",
  "The case got tons of\nnews coverage, you know.": "",
  "I was also wondering what you thought.\nAbout the case.": "",
  "Yagami-san... I was also wondering what you thought.\nAbout the case, I mean.": "",
  "Did you really think that he was innocent?": "",
  "Did you really think he was innocent?": "",
  "...Guess I did.": "",
  "But then he walked...\nand killed his girlfriend.": "",
  "You defended him for that too, yeah?": "",
  "You defended him\nfor that too, yeah?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(...I did. Okubo-san asked me to\nafter he murdered Emi-chan in cold blood.)</color>": "",
  "Did you believe him then, too?": "",
  "So even then?\nYou still believed in him?": "",
  "He kept saying the same thing.\nHow he could never have killed anyone.": "",
  "Okubo kept saying the same thing.\nHow he would never kill them.": "",
  "But I...": "",
  "I didn't believe him, no.": "",
  "Fighting for him in court made me\nsick to my stomach.": "",
  "Every time I declared his innocence in that court...\nI felt sick to my stomach.": "",
  "Do you think he deserves the death penalty?": "",
  "Okay. So you figure Okubo deserves\nthe death penalty?": "",
  "That's enough of the questions, Sugiura.": "",
  "That's enough already, Sugiura.": "",
  "My bad.\nWas that too far?": "",
  "Did I push it too far?": "",
  "You're heading to the ADDC now, yes?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Whoa.": "โว้ว",
  "Yeah. Thanks.": "เออ ขอบใจ",
  "Yeah, I'll see you.": "อือ แล้วเจอกัน",
  "Hm...": "อืม...",
  "Thank you for waiting.": "ขอบคุณที่รอนะคะ",
  "But I...": "แต่ผม..."
 }
}
